TI  - Educational Needs Assessment for Family Caregivers of Dementia Patients.
PG  - 1528-1529
LID - 10.3233/SHTI231277 [doi]
AB  - People living with dementia are highly dependent on caregivers. We conducted an 
      online survey with regard to caregivers' educational experiences, needs, and 
      expectations. We found that most of the participants lacked educational 
      experiences and expected updated methods through metaverse in virtual reality. 
      Therefore, future studies should verify the effectiveness of education.
