      Torres, Cole G Craven, Adam Dubrowski, Bill Kapralos, Erica O’Hare, Joel Sadavoy, 
      Adriana Shnall, Michael S D Smith, Nusrat Choudhury, Amer M Burhan. Originally 
      published in JMIR Research Protocols (https://www.researchprotocols.org).
